<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6800" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακρεμ-άννῡμι</span></b> , poet. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκρ-</span></b> :—
			Pass.
		, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κρέμᾰμαι</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hang up on</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πασσάλῳ ἀγκρεμάσασα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.440
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πέδας ἀνεκρέμασαν ἐς τὴν
				ἀκρόπολιν,</span> as a votive offering, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.77
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὅπλα πρὸς τὸ
			Ἀθήναιον</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				95
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τινά</span>”
				<i>crucify,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.120
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροχὸν ἑαυτῷ περιθεὶς ἀνεκρέμασε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					2.6
				</span></i>
			; <i>suspend</i> a wounded limb in a sling, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				22
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακρεμαμένου τοῦ νέκυος</span>”
				<i>being hung up,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.121
				</span></i>
			.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γ́; τούτου . . τοῦ ἀνακρεμασθέντος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.122
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				7.194
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make dependent,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐξ ἀλλήλων τὴν δύναμιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ion</u>
					536a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνακρεμάσας [ὑμᾶς] ἀπὸ τῶν ἐλπίδων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.100
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὴν πίστιν εἴς τινα</span> Pib.<i><span class="en">
				8.19.3
			</span></i>.</div>
